"link","title":null,"url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/momo-matsumoto-746594290/","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Momo","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":255,"offset":282},"end":{"line":4,"column":259,"offset":286}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":254,"offset":281},"end":{"line":4,"column":315,"offset":342}}},{"type":"text","value":", meiner Partnerin. Der Dienstplan-Bot brachte diese Arbeit dorthin, wo das Team ohnehin schrieb: nach Telegram.","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":315,"offset":342},"end":{"line":4,"column":427,"offset":454}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":1,"offset":28},"end":{"line":4,"column":427,"offset":454}}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Was OpenClaw ist","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":4,"offset":459},"end":{"line":6,"column":20,"offset":475}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1,"offset":456},"end":{"line":6,"column":20,"offset":475}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"OpenClaw ist ein Open-Source-Gateway für persönliche KI-Assistenten. Es läuft self-hosted auf eigener Hardware und verbindet einen Assistenten mit Messengern wie Telegram oder WhatsApp. Statt einer eigenen App mit eigenen Logins bekommt das Team einfach einen Kontakt im Messenger, dem es schreiben kann.","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1,"offset":477},"end":{"line":8,"column":305,"offset":781}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":1,"offset":477},"end":{"line":8,"column":305,"offset":781}}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Der Bot im Alltag","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":4,"offset":786},"end":{"line":10,"column":21,"offset":803}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1,"offset":783},"end":{"line":10,"column":21,"offset":803}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Für Bäckerherz lief auf dieser Basis ein Dienstplan-Bot in Telegram. Das Team konnte Dienstpläne direkt im Chat abstimmen und nachfragen, ohne ei